   "zh": "下限：BMI 再低，皮肤就会收到肌肉和骨以内——肌肉不随 BMI 变细，深部结构穿出皮肤超过 2 mm 的采样点比例会比默认（1%）多出 1 个百分点以上；也不低于胖瘦场表格的最小值 18.5。上限：胖瘦场表格的最大值 40。",
   "en": "Lower bound: below it the skin would shrink inside muscle and bone — muscles do not thin with BMI, and the share of sampled deep-part vertices more than 2 mm outside the skin would exceed the default (1 %) by more than 1 percentage points; nor below 18.5, the lowest BMI of the fat-field table. Upper bound: 40, the highest BMI of the table."
